920 FOR I=0 TO 2:SO%(I)=SH%(I+1)-1:NEXT I
930 FOR S=0 TO 2
940 NN=3:GOSUB 1310
950 FOR I=0 TO 2:CS%(S,I)=SH%(I+1)-1:NEXT I
960 NEXT S
