1060 R3=RX-INT(RX/3)*3
1070 IN=3*R3+INT(RX/3)+CX
1080 BS=IN-INT(IN/9)*9
1090 G%(R+1,C+1)=DP%(BS):F%(R+1,C+1)=1
1100 NEXT C
